{"id": "DeGtjz6kV5N", "title": "Video by githubsignals", "description": "Papermorph: The AI That Animates Your Textbooks\n\nPapermorph is the AI skill that turns static PDFs into living, narrated web experiences. It solves the problem of dry, unengaging textbooks by transforming flat pages into interactive lessons with voice narration and animated visuals. The most surprising part is that it does this entirely by generating code and storyboards, without needing any image generation models. You just feed it a book, and it builds a browsable website where you can watch lessons and take quizzes right in your browser. If you want to make your own course materials feel less like homework and more like a movie, this is the tool to check out.\n\nOpen source: dozentwelve/papermorph\n\nFollow for more open source project drops.\n\n#InteractiveLearning #CourseCreation #InstructionalDesign #TeacherResources", "channel": "githubsignals", "uploader_id": "36619078976", "uploader": "Github Signals", "timestamp": 1791186650, "like_count": 2119, "comment_count": 99, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18106909934222977a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 42.456, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPblLzq2a38AVTgOa8nJKAu_TB0_7lGizsQkPbtsIyHIXCwuIK4ejV0CluK97pL4qfIbmHEChQdzdc3WJ5oP9PNxPRe27WMu1B72pw.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=1KIKTkVSMXAQ7kNvwF3nupE&%3D&ccb=17-1&_n